<title>FRANCE: TF1 Q3 sales rise.</title>
<headline>TF1 Q3 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					1,840    vs   1,724</p>
<p>     of which advertising TF1		 1,398    vs   1,359</p>
<p>     diversification				442    vs     365</p>
<p>NOTE - The company gave the results in a financial advertisement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
